speechtext:
Before the hon. member offers his amendment I have one which I wish to submit myself, just to show that we are not altogether hard-hearted in our attitude towards the fishermen. I move:
That the words " gasoline engines to be used in boats bona fide owned by individual fishermen for their own personal use in the fisheries " be inserted after the figures "1017" in the thirteenth line;
That the words " gasoline engines to be used in boats bona fide owned by individual fishermen for their own personal use in the fisheries " be inserted after the figures "1017" in the twenty-fifth line;
And that the words " gasoline engines to be used in boats bona fide owned by individual fishermen for their own personal use in the fisheries " be inserted after the figures " 1017 " in the thirty-ninth line.
Ways and Means-Sales Tax
